From: GhostDelta_GC_SUM (a.k.a. "GS") policy — SPDK port reference
Purpose: cumulative CB-scan estimate of G(u+θ) for hill-climb on target_valid_blk_rate.

Apply hint: SPDK baseline differs from cache_sim baseline. This patch is REFERENCE-ONLY;
adapt names/types to SPDK conventions. The 6 hunks below are *additions* you need to
graft into corresponding files in your SPDK tree.

